{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04483","headline":"赠严仓曹乞推命录 · 陈子昂","name":"赠严仓曹乞推命录","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少学纵横术，游楚复游燕。\n栖遑长委命，富贵未知天。\n闻道沈冥客，青囊有秘篇。\n九宫探万象，三算极重玄。\n愿奉唐生诀，将知跃马年。\n非同墨翟问，空滞杀龙川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04483.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04483","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}